[meta] Malformed EMD Test Cases
This file contains intentionally broken EMD syntax.
Each section describes what is broken and what the expected diagnostic output should be.
Used for testing parser error recovery and diagnostic rendering.

## [bug|done] Missing Closing Bracket in Section Header
This section header is missing the closing bracket: `## [task` — the parser should recover and treat it as a plain heading.
Expected diagnostic: "Malformed section header: missing closing bracket" at line 17.

## [bug|done] Unknown Section Type
## [faketype|done] This Type Does Not Exist
Content for a section with an invalid type. The parser should flag this as an unknown type but still parse the section structure.
Expected diagnostic: "Unknown section type: 'faketype'" at line 22.

## [bug|done] Unknown Status
## [task|notreal] Invalid Status
Content for a section with an invalid status. The status should be ignored but the section type should still parse.
Expected diagnostic: "Unknown status: 'notreal'" at line 28.

## [bug|done] Invalid Status Format
## [task|done|extra] Too Many Bars
Content for a section with too many status separators. Parser should handle gracefully.
Expected diagnostic: "Malformed section header: unexpected token after status" at line 34.

## [bug|done] Broken Semantic Link
→ not-a-valid-link-format
This semantic link is missing the colon separator. The parser should flag it as a malformed link.
Expected diagnostic: "Invalid semantic link: missing colon" at line 39.

## [bug|done] Unclosed Code Fence
```python
def broken_function():
  print("This code fence never closes")
  return None

The parser should detect that the code fence was never closed and include all remaining text.
Expected diagnostic: "Unclosed code fence starting at line 45" at line 45.

## [bug|done] Unclosed Wiki Link
References to [[some-page should be rendered as plain text since the brackets are not balanced.
Expected diagnostic: "Unclosed wiki-link bracket" at line 56.

## [bug|done] Malformed Status in Nested Section
### [task|not-real-status] Invalid Nested Status
The status contains hyphens which may be ambiguous with section nesting.
Expected diagnostic: "Unknown status in nested section" at line 62.

## [bug|done] Empty Section Type
## [|done] Empty Type
Content for a section with an empty type. The parser should create a section with an empty or unknown type.
Expected diagnostic: "Empty section type" at line 67.

## [bug|done] Whitespace-Only Type
## [   ] Whitespace Type
Content for a section with whitespace-only type. The parser should strip whitespace and treat as empty type.
Expected diagnostic: "Empty section type after trimming" at line 72.

## [bug|done] Multiple Brackets
## [[extra] section] Double Brackets
Content where the type has extra brackets. The parser should handle the inner brackets.
Expected diagnostic: "Malformed section type: nested brackets" at line 77.

## [bug|done] Link with No Target
→ depends:
This semantic link has a relation but no target. Parser should flag it.
Expected diagnostic: "Semantic link missing target" at line 82.

## [bug|done] Bare Arrow
→
This is just an arrow with no relation or target. Parser should ignore or flag.
Expected diagnostic: "Malformed semantic link: missing relation" at line 87.
